# Advanced Portfolio Risk Engine & Tail-Risk Stress Tester

**Conditional Value-at-Risk (CVaR) portfolio optimization via the Rockafellar–Uryasev linear programming formulation, extended with multi-objective optimization and non-linear stress testing.**

