├── rtr179-CVaR1.pdf                 # source paper
└── README.md
```

> **Note.** `notebooks/` and a top-level `data/` directory are not present in the current tree — market data is generated analytically from the paper's published parameters rather than loaded from disk. `notebooks/` is tracked in the [Roadmap](#roadmap).

